    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nNo. 23 Yellow Clay Manor is a well-presented, ground floor, two-bedroom own-door apartment, ideally situated within this popular residential development. The property is conveniently located close to a host of local amenities and is within easy walking distance of Navan town centre.\n\nThe apartment benefits from well-proportioned accommodation throughout and offers a comfortable, practical layout. It enjoys a central location, close to Beechmount Shopping Centre, while Navan town centre is approximately a 15-minute stroll away.\n\nExcellent transport links are also on offer, with the M3 and N2 accessible within minutes by car, and a regular bus service operating in the area.\n\nNo. 23 is a versatile property that is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers, making early viewing highly recommended."
      },
